    rdfs:label "additional_licenses" ;
    rdfs:comment "[reusability_if_applicable] List of additional licenses that apply to subsets of the dataset, if any. e.g., if a dataset contains third-party data with different licensing terms, those can be captured here. Each entry should include the same fields as the main license block above, along with a description of which subset of the data it applies to." ;
